## 📊 CORE WEB VITALS BUDGETS

### **Budjetit: LCP < 2.5s, CLS < 0.1** (Budgets: LCP < 2.5s, CLS < 0.1)
Performance budgets must be strictly maintained. If limits are exceeded, suggest corrections.

### **Performance Budgets**
- **LCP (Largest Contentful Paint)**: < 2.5 seconds
- **CLS (Cumulative Layout Shift)**: < 0.1
- **FID (First Input Delay)**: < 100ms
- **FCP (First Contentful Paint)**: < 1.8 seconds
- **TTFB (Time to First Byte)**: < 800ms

### **Budget Monitoring**
```typescript
// Performance monitoring setup
export const performanceBudgets = {
  lcp: 2500, // 2.5 seconds
  cls: 0.1,  // 0.1
  fid: 100,  // 100ms
  fcp: 1800, // 1.8 seconds
  ttfb: 800  // 800ms
};

// Budget violation detection
export function checkPerformanceBudget(metrics: PerformanceMetrics) {
  const violations = [];
  
  if (metrics.lcp > performanceBudgets.lcp) {
    violations.push({
      metric: 'LCP',
      current: metrics.lcp,
      budget: performanceBudgets.lcp,
      suggestions: getLCPSuggestions(metrics.lcp)
    });
  }
  
  if (metrics.cls > performanceBudgets.cls) {
    violations.push({
      metric: 'CLS',
      current: metrics.cls,
      budget: performanceBudgets.cls,
      suggestions: getCLSSuggestions(metrics.cls)
    });
  }
  
  return violations;
}
```

### **Correction Suggestions When Limits Exceeded**

#### **LCP > 2.5s Suggestions**
```typescript
export function getLCPSuggestions(lcp: number): string[] {
  const suggestions = [];
  
  if (lcp > 4000) {
    suggestions.push(
      'Optimize hero image: compress, use WebP format, implement responsive images',
      'Reduce server response time: optimize database queries, implement caching',
      'Minimize render-blocking resources: defer non-critical CSS/JS'
    );
  } else if (lcp > 3000) {
    suggestions.push(
      'Implement image lazy loading for below-the-fold images',
      'Optimize font loading: use font-display: swap',
      'Reduce bundle size: code splitting, tree shaking'
    );
  } else {
    suggestions.push(
      'Monitor performance trends',
      'Consider implementing resource hints (preload, prefetch)'
    );
  }
  
  return suggestions;
}
```

#### **CLS > 0.1 Suggestions**
```typescript
export function getCLSSuggestions(cls: number): string[] {
  const suggestions = [];
  
  if (cls > 0.25) {
    suggestions.push(
      'Set explicit dimensions for all images and media elements',
      'Reserve space for dynamic content (ads, embeds)',
      'Avoid inserting content above existing content'
    );
  } else if (cls > 0.15) {
    suggestions.push(
      'Use CSS aspect-ratio for responsive images',
      'Implement skeleton screens for dynamic content',
      'Ensure consistent spacing and layout'
    );
  } else {
    suggestions.push(
      'Review layout stability',
      'Test with different content lengths'
    );
  }
  
  return suggestions;
}
```

## 🔤 FONT OPTIMIZATION

### **Fontit: next/font; vain tarvittavat painot** (Fonts: next/font; only necessary weights)
Use Next.js built-in font optimization with only required font weights.

### **Font Implementation**
```typescript
// /lib/fonts.ts
import { Inter, Playfair_Display } from 'next/font/google';

// Inter font - only necessary weights
export const inter = Inter({
  subsets: ['latin'],
  weight: ['400', '500'], // Regular and Medium only
  display: 'swap',
  variable: '--font-inter',
});

// Playfair Display - only necessary weights
export const playfair = Playfair_Display({
  subsets: ['latin'],
  weight: ['400'], // Regular only
  display: 'swap',
  variable: '--font-playfair',
});
```

### **Font Display Strategy**
- **Font-display: swap**: Show fallback font immediately, swap when custom font loads
- **Font-display: optional**: Use custom font only if it loads quickly
- **Preload Critical Fonts**: Preload above-the-fold fonts

### **Font Loading Best Practices**
```tsx
// Font preloading in layout
<link
  rel="preload"
  href="/fonts/inter-400.woff2"
  as="font"
  type="font/woff2"
  crossOrigin="anonymous"
/>

// CSS variables for font usage
:root {
  --font-inter: ${inter.style.fontFamily};
  --font-playfair: ${playfair.style.fontFamily};
}
```

### **Font Weight Strategy**
- **Inter**: 400 (Regular), 500 (Medium) - avoid 300, 600, 700
- **Playfair Display**: 400 (Regular) - avoid 500, 600, 700
- **Remove Unused Weights**: Eliminate unused font files
- **Font Subsetting**: Only include required characters

## 🖼️ IMAGE OPTIMIZATION

### **Kuvat: määritä sizes; lazy oletuksena, priority vain above-the-fold** (Images: define sizes; lazy by default, priority only for above-the-fold)

### **Image Implementation Rules**
```tsx
// Above-the-fold image with priority
<Image
  src="/hero-image.jpg"
  alt="Professional team collaborating"
  width={800}
  height={600}
  priority={true} // Only for above-the-fold
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 33vw"
  className="w-full h-auto"
/>

// Below-the-fold image with lazy loading (default)
<Image
  src="/team-photo.jpg"
  alt="Our team at work"
  width={400}
  height={300}
  sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 25vw"
  className="w-full h-auto"
  // lazy loading is default
/>
```

### **Image Sizes Strategy**
```tsx
// Responsive image sizes
const imageSizes = {
  hero: "(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 80vw, 1200px",
  card: "(max-width: 768px) 100vw, (max-width: 1200px) 50vw, 400px",
  thumbnail: "(max-width: 768px) 50vw, (max-width: 1200px) 25vw, 200px",
  icon: "48px"
};

// Usage
<Image
  src="/feature-icon.svg"
  alt="Feature icon"
  width={48}
  height={48}
  sizes={imageSizes.icon}
  className="w-12 h-12"
/>
```

### **Image Optimization Requirements**
- **Format Selection**: WebP with JPEG fallback
- **Responsive Images**: Multiple sizes for different screen sizes
- **Lazy Loading**: Default behavior for below-the-fold images
- **Priority Loading**: Only for critical above-the-fold images
- **Alt Text**: Descriptive alt text for accessibility

